{
  "info": {
    "name": "RentNest API",
    "description": "RentNest rental marketplace API (Express, TypeScript, Prisma, PostgreSQL, Stripe).\n\n1. Set `baseUrl` (local: http://localhost:4000, or the live URL).\n2. Run the three Login requests in Auth; tokens are stored automatically.\n3. IDs (propertyId, categoryId, rentalId, paymentId, userId) are captured from responses.\n\nSuccess: { success, message, data, meta? } · Error: { success: false, message, errorDetails }",
